      "InputId": "afb22fff-6a74-5f28-893e-950eb71eba4d",
      "Description": "Dilate grows the surface outwards by Radius: crisp letters turn into bubbles.",
      "Style": "InfoFor"
    },
    {
      "Id": "ead57cfc-c60d-5b0e-87b7-0e6a49f19f03",
