      "InputId": "8a3c8412-7266-50ce-83ba-7841bb431863",
      "Description": "[VolumeFromPoints] adds a soft ball of density around every point; close balls merge.",
      "Style": "InfoFor"
    },
    {
      "Id": "7f253c9f-2538-5df3-99cd-711922cc5546",
